      "end": "01:47.123",
      "words": [
        "01:36.789",
        "01:40.429",
        "01:40.721",
        "01:41.498",
        "01:41.962",
        "01:42.316",
        "01:43.210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yet this bond of hope,",
      "time": "01:48.929",
      "end": "01:52.280",
      "words": [
        "01:48.929",
        "01:49.257",
        "01:49.650",
        "01:50.550",
        "01:51.345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By treachery was broke,",
      "time": "01:52.576",
      "end": "01:55.525",
      "words": [
        "01:52.576",
        "01:52.815",
        "01:53.963",
        "01:54.351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Scattering her words to the wind.",
      "time": "01:55.998",
      "end": "02:02.083",
      "words": [
        "01:55.998",
        "01:57.174",
        "01:57.566",
        "01:58.575",
        "01:58.871",
        "01:59.303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Swelling overlong, seas of blood, are a song",
      "time": "02:31.066",
      "end": "02:41.567",
      "words": [
        "02:31.066",
        "02:32.880",
        "02:36.697",
        "02:37.134",
        "02:37.447",
        "02:39.711",
        "02:40.007",
        "02:40.440"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And death an afterthought,",
      "time": "02:43.187",
      "end": "02:48.840",
      "words": [
        "02:43.187",
        "02:43.531",
        "02:44.715",
        "02:45.082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To those who fight for naught.",
      "time": "02:49.233",
      "end": "02:54.656",
      "words": [
        "02:49.233",
        "02:49.568",
        "02:50.833",
        "02:51.145",
        "02:51.869",
        "02:52.770"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A throne, lying empty...",
      "time": "02:55.136",
      "end": "03:06.912",
      "words": [
        "02:55.136",
        "02:55.787",
        "03:00.464",
        "03:02.067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A reign incomplete.",
      "time": "03:07.370",
      "end": "03:19.251",
      "words": [
        "03:07.370",
        "03:08.172",
        "03:12.789"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alone for eternity...",
      "time": "03:19.774",
      "end": "03:31.535",
      "words": [
        "03:19.774",
        "03:25.048",
        "03:25.974"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A pain without cease.",
      "time": "03:32.120",
      "end": "03:44.490",
      "words": [
        "03:32.120",
        "03:32.771",
        "03:37.454",
        "03:39.267"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Children of the land answer this:",
      "time": "04:15.903",
      "end": "04:21.246",
      "words": [
        "04:15.903",
        "04:16.739",
        "04:17.060",
        "04:17.492",
        "04:18.314",
        "04:19.004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Why must you turn to empty bliss?",
      "time": "04:22.049",
      "end": "04:26.955",
      "words": [
        "04:22.049",
        "04:22.345",
        "04:22.706",
        "04:23.059",
        "04:23.872",
        "04:24.314",
        "04:25.020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tell me why break trust?",
      "time": "04:27.386",
      "end": "04:30.576",
      "words": [
        "04:27.386",
        "04:27.702",
        "04:28.139",
        "04:28.984",
        "04:29.691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Why turn the past to dust?",
      "time": "04:30.932",
      "end": "04:33.821",
      "words": [
        "04:30.932",
        "04:31.198",
        "04:31.525",
        "04:31.924",
        "04:32.309",
        "04:32.702"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Seeking solace in the abyss.",
      "time": "04:34.252",
      "end": "04:39.227",
      "words": [
        "04:34.252",
        "04:34.977",
        "04:35.837",
        "04:36.511",
        "04:36.979"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tell me why create a circle none can break?",
      "time": "04:39.620",
      "end": "04:46.285",
      "words": [
        "04:39.620",
        "04:39.955",
        "04:40.363",
        "04:41.256",
        "04:43.230",
        "04:43.523",
        "04:44.286",
        "04:44.631",
        "04:45.444"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Why must you let go the life you were bestowed?",
      "time": "04:46.629",
      "end": "04:52.225",
      "words": [
        "04:46.629",
        "04:47.013",
        "04:47.382",
        "04:47.743",
        "04:48.191",
        "04:49.390",
        "04:49.702",
        "04:50.120",
        "04:50.464",
        "04:50.890"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This I'll fear I'll never know!",
      "time": "04:52.740",
      "end": "04:59.873",
      "words": [
        "04:52.740",
        "04:53.149",
        "04:53.558",
        "04:53.925",
        "04:54.431",
        "04:55.904"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Never know...",
      "time": "05:00.918",
      "end": "05:07.127",
      "words": [
        "05:00.918",
        "05:03.284"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beneath the gazing stars",
